  "html": "<main>\n    <section class=\"cat-hero container\" data-stagger>\n      <p class=\"cat-hero__eyebrow\">Research &amp; Survey</p>\n      <h1>Evidence you can build decisions on.</h1>\n      <p class=\"cat-hero__sub\">Rigorous research, surveys and impact assessment that surface what's real — so strategy and programmes stand on solid ground.</p>\n      <div class=\"cat-hero__cta\">\n        <a class=\"btn-hello btn-primary\" href=\"/sayhello/\" data-contact-open>Book a conversation <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>\n        <a class=\"btn-hello\" href=\"/our-work/\">See our work <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">What we do</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Capabilities</h2>\n        <p class=\"cat-section__sub reveal\">Seven research and evidence capabilities, from field surveys to impact assessment.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-grid\" data-stagger>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/40ad50_ec6299ef38da46169f6c29d84b780eae.webp\" alt=\"Diversity, equality and inclusion research woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Diversity, Equality &amp; Inclusion Research</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Guide change with actionable inclusion insights.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/310ca6_71a560733bd646bf8b813384bec9aad7.webp\" alt=\"Climate research woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Climate Research</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Build resilience with evidence-based climate data.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/40ad50_f910006c3bf846c0bb14b4f90f6fa050.webp\" alt=\"Sustainability research woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Sustainability Research</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Drive impact with expert sustainability data.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/40ad50_aa54d2ddb1744c4c95ae5f978031e6e5.webp\" alt=\"Tourism research woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Tourism Research</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Drive destination growth with market analysis.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/40ad50_2375b84ed7aa439abda6d9772a47157f.webp\" alt=\"Community research woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Community Research</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Design impactful solutions using local insights.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/40ad50_f1241c0c8f654881b1e1706de178ea5b.webp\" alt=\"Surveys woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Surveys</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Collect reliable data through structured feedback.</p></div>\n          </article>\n          <article class=\"cat-svc\">\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/solutions/40ad50_b728901d28d149acafeb421a69068471.webp\" alt=\"Impact assessment woodcut icon\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cat-svc__body\"><h3 class=\"cat-svc__title\">Impact Assessment</h3><p class=\"cat-svc__desc\">Measure outcomes to demonstrate project effectiveness.</p></div>\n          </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">How we work</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Our approach</h2>\n        <p class=\"cat-section__sub reveal\">Not a fixed sequence &mdash; these four practices connect in every direction. Start wherever you are, and we cycle through the rest as the work needs.</p>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__badge reveal\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 1 3 6.7\"/><path d=\"M3 21v-5h5\"/></svg> Start anywhere &mdash; it&rsquo;s a loop</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-cycle reveal\">\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Understand</h3>\n          <p>We start with the people and the context — research, listening and evidence before anything else.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 8l-4 4 4 4\"/><path d=\"M17 8l4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span>\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 20h9\"/><path d=\"M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Design</h3>\n          <p>Insights become a clear plan: strategy, story, instrument or curriculum shaped for who it's for.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 8l-4 4 4 4\"/><path d=\"M17 8l4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span>\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><path d=\"M3.3 7 12 12l8.7-5M12 22V12\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Deliver</h3>\n          <p>We produce and run it in the real world — assets, campaigns, studies or sessions.</p>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"cat-cycle__link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 8l-4 4 4 4\"/><path d=\"M17 8l4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M3 12h18\"/></svg></span>\n        <div class=\"cat-cycle__node\">\n          <span class=\"cat-cycle__ico\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8\"/><path d=\"M17 7h4v4\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>Grow</h3>\n          <p>We measure what happened and iterate, turning a one-off into lasting, compounding impact.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">Proof</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Selected work</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-workgrid\" data-stagger>\n          <a class=\"cat-work\" href=\"/work/mirik-college/\">\n            <div class=\"cat-work__media\"><img src=\"/assets/img/our-work/40ad50_1c7d55c88a3f421f9bff620f20028e04.webp\" alt=\"Mirik College — Studio 1947 project\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <h3 class=\"cat-work__title\">Mirik College</h3>\n            <p class=\"cat-work__desc\">Field research and survey collaboration</p>\n            <span class=\"cat-work__link\">View project\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"cat-work\" href=\"/work/local-futures/\">\n            <div class=\"cat-work__media cat-work__media--contain\"><img src=\"/assets/img/work/local-futures/hero.webp\" alt=\"Local Futures — brand lockup\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <h3 class=\"cat-work__title\">Local Futures</h3>\n            <p class=\"cat-work__desc\">Research and localisation for an ecology non-profit</p>\n            <span class=\"cat-work__link\">View project\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"cat-work\" href=\"/work/village-ways/\">\n            <div class=\"cat-work__media cat-work__media--contain\"><img src=\"/assets/img/work/village-ways/hero.webp\" alt=\"Village Ways — brand lockup\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            <h3 class=\"cat-work__title\">Village Ways</h3>\n            <p class=\"cat-work__desc\">Community research for responsible tourism</p>\n            <span class=\"cat-work__link\">View project\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n          </a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section container\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n      <div class=\"cat-section__head\">\n        <p class=\"cat-section__eyebrow reveal\">Keep exploring</p>\n        <h2 class=\"cat-section__title reveal\">Related solutions</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cat-related reveal\">\n          <a class=\"cat-related__item\" href=\"/solutions/data-design-tech/\">Data, Design &amp; Tech<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n          <a class=\"cat-related__item\" href=\"/solutions/communication-campaign/\">Communication &amp; Campaign<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n          <a class=\"cat-related__item\" href=\"/solutions/capacity-building/\">Capacity Building<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>"
